command: cmd /c "$q -machine help" 2>&1 | Select-String "none|isapc|pc-i440fx-4.0"

pc                   Standard PC (i440FX + PIIX, 1996) (alias of pc-i440fx-4.0)
pc-i440fx-4.0        Standard PC (i440FX + PIIX, 1996) (default)
isapc                ISA-only PC
none                 empty machine


